{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Newark Liberty International Airport\u00a0(EWR) is the nation\u2019s oldest airfield and home to the nation\u2019s\u00a0first commercial airline terminal. EWR is located only 14 miles\u00a0from Manhattan, serving a critical role for the New York/Newark metropolitan area.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The airport spans over 2,000 acres and has multiple runways, making it a crucial global air travel gateway. EWR has three terminals: Terminal A, Terminal B, and Terminal C.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The largest airport system in the U.S. is made up of the trio of La Guardia Airport (included in the base game), John F. Kennedy Airport (available also for Tower Simulator), and Newark Airport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4L/22R: 11,000 by 150 feet (3,353\u00a0m \u00d7\u00a046\u00a0m), asphalt/concrete, grooved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4R/22L: 9,999 by 150 feet (3,048\u00a0m \u00d7\u00a046\u00a0m), asphalt, grooved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11/29: 6,725 by 150 feet (2,050\u00a0m \u00d7\u00a046\u00a0m), asphalt, grooved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helipad H1: 54 by 54 feet (16\u00a0m \u00d7\u00a016\u00a0m), asphalt</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The airport has more than 12 miles of 75-foot-wide taxiways.  Three of the new taxiways allow multiple planes to stage for departure at the end of the runway, reducing takeoff delays, while the other new taxiway will allow arriving planes to exit the runway faster and get to the gates quicker.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094140?t=1760607750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094140/1a6b24ad36004a6a5e6c9298537023ffda9d4699/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760607750","capsule_image":"https:/